# Supabase
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# STAGE 18 — MyFatoorah (Kuwait, KWD). No VITE_ variable is needed on the
# frontend at all — this integration never talks to MyFatoorah directly
# from the browser (see supabase/functions/_shared/myfatoorah.ts).
#
# Set these as Supabase Edge Function secrets instead, e.g.:
#   supabase secrets set MYFATOORAH_API_KEY=...
#   supabase secrets set MYFATOORAH_IS_TEST=true
#   supabase secrets set MYFATOORAH_WEBHOOK_SECRET_KEY=...   (optional, once enabled in the MyFatoorah portal)
#   supabase secrets set SITE_URL=https://your-live-domain.example   (fallback only — the frontend normally sends its own origin)
#
# The following are documented here for reference ONLY — do NOT add a
# VITE_ prefixed version of any of these, and do NOT put real values in
# this file:
# MYFATOORAH_API_KEY=
# MYFATOORAH_IS_TEST=true
# MYFATOORAH_WEBHOOK_SECRET_KEY=
# SITE_URL=
